{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_title", "source_sha256": "b0eb61ed588133f885deb771730f2167be682c6c0f4985db704c967993176d79", "ja": "ただいまの言える場所", "zh": "可以说“我回来了”的归宿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0322cd4f01c73cee1cc1dab9053bebac150d4f2e2ebbaa8139b4b1e369df4f9d", "ja": "『LOVERS HEART』のツアーが全て終わ\nり、地元に帰ってきたアイドル達。ツアーも\n楽しかったけど、やっぱりみんな一緒がいい\nねと、劇場での日常へ戻っていくのだった。", "zh": "结束了“LOVERS HEART”全部巡演的\n偶像们回到了自己的大本营。虽然巡演也\n很开心，但大家果然还是一起最好呢——\n就这样，她们回到了在剧场的日常生活之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d80cfb0e8609822445dd204366c8dc2b51b680471df72cc357851229917ebe0f", "ja": "（LOVERS HEARTの集大成ライブを終え、\n劇場へと帰還！　実りの多いツアーだったな……）", "zh": "（结束了LOVERS HEART的收官演唱会，回到了剧场！真是一次收获满满的巡演啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "6b73b51828bad5d01f7d9214ef46cecf995d3fc4b04dcebfdc3ab862c9075dfe", "ja": "家から劇場に行くのと同じぐらいの時間で、\n東京に着いちゃった！　新幹線ってすごいな～。", "zh": "花的时间跟从家里去剧场差不多，\n就到东京了！新干线真厉害啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "263f617f4e2ae068d431175e401a6af984f490f7916e5b94ff71dea744e5cd41", "ja": "予想より早かったな。翼へのお土産を考えてる\n時間のほうが、よっぽど長かった気がするよ……。", "zh": "比预想的还要快啊。感觉光是考虑给翼买什么伴手礼，花的时间都比这长多了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2f420c0d400d06688a2bfd4b58a6320a3affc53c27ec23984d1a484e4f0f00d7", "ja": "「ジュリアに選んでほしい」っていう、\n翼のリクエストだったからな……。", "zh": "毕竟翼提了要求，\n说是“希望由茱莉亚来选”嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "7ae501e6ee0c6dcb27055915a700282d017bb25687e8d88f99f00dd929fe6ceb", "ja": "なんで、よりによってあたしに頼むんだか……。\n気にいらなくても、クレームは受け付けないからな。", "zh": "为什么偏偏要拜托我啊……  \n就算你不喜欢，我也不接受投诉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "d63e87e1522c0445e55d775d94538d161fa4720761b66840c0e59368b1c32e64", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんが一生懸命選んだんだもん。\n気に入らないなんて、絶対言わないと思うけどな。", "zh": "茱莉亚辛辛苦苦挑选的嘛。应该绝对不会说不喜欢吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "8faa54045fa41fc286fe63bd9f2c04c0636ef9b99ba25725a3d99578260e2821", "ja": "私も志保ちゃんと、恵美さんにお土産を買いました！\n亜利沙さんと、ふたりで選んだんですよ～♪", "zh": "我也给志保和惠美买了伴手礼！是我和亚利沙两个人一起挑的哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "11c454fd081cf52be168f884d20b09c02390c43c9fdb3c4d3af28570ffd57a20", "ja": "杏奈も……ロコと、瑞希さんに……。\n名古屋限定の、ゲームキャラ、グッズ……。", "zh": "杏奈也给……ROCO和瑞希小姐……买了。\n名古屋限定的游戏角色周边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8bf2231560f9cb31d10fccd1c852b6b09db30919e5705c627c5f6f542b6676ed", "ja": "みんな、たくさん買ってたな。\nお土産選びも、旅の楽しさのひとつって感じかな。", "zh": "大家都买了好多啊。\n挑选伴手礼，也算是旅行乐趣的一部分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "ff62d55d3594bb55fdcdb0d40f9f54b73f2e5b5180e999c6b3aee05f26962e5d", "ja": "はい。それに、ツアーが終わりに近づくにつれて、\n劇場のみんなのことを思い出すことが増えちゃって。", "zh": "是的。而且随着巡演逐渐接近尾声，我也越来越常想起剧场的大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "1f61e28503a031d6b65f03ccd1bf4b2f7bcc7e97b758712523f8a93e76b43b93", "ja": "あっ、私もです！　はやくお土産渡したいな～、\n喜んでくれるかな～って、ずっと考えちゃいました！", "zh": "啊，我也是！一直在想好想快点把伴手礼送给大家啊～，\n大家会不会开心呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "ff2b73bb6d29e901ae127dd79a8680c20a7ee0495b1bde107c3dbd015621fcb8", "ja": "行ったり来たりで、会えないやつも多かったからな。\n離れたことで、大事さがわかる、っていうか……。", "zh": "来来去去的，好多人都没能见到。分开一段时间，才更明白对方的重要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "c2bd27518ee11bb9ce0bdea2c7e9c3e5ddabbc81ee55a4d025f3fa1ee99f3c90", "ja": "でも……今日から、また……\n劇場のみんなと、いっしょ……です……。", "zh": "但是……从今天开始，又能和剧场的大家……在一起……了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "00ac23edbe3906fb611a46e36a67f8fd2aab894a473749d6f83fc2597ca7992d", "ja": "うん！　帰って来たぞ矢吹可奈～♪\n笑顔で迎えてほしいかな～♪", "zh": "嗯！我回来了哦，矢吹可奈～♪\n希望大家能用笑容迎接我～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "2a4b961f7b5a7920d151f1888629021a3d2ed8538e700a95bbc4404404439492", "ja": "みんなの顔、見に……\n杏奈も……劇場に、帰ります……♪", "zh": "去看看……大家的脸……\n杏奈也……要回剧场了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_epi03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "91979a13742c980f0d8c1f2af70d9f90458e66fc80d686416300246a187aa049", "ja": "（目まぐるしかったツアーから、いつもの日常に。\n今回の経験が、また劇場を大きくしてくれるはずだ！）", "zh": "（从忙碌的巡演回到往常的日子。这次的经历，一定也会让剧场变得更加壮大！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
